  m_text: 'Through heavy thoughts that weighed you down, you were able to persevere
    and delve further, discovered places you couldn''t believe. The dream was but
    a hazy memory, lingering in the back of your head.


    You wake up to a new
    dawn, with a fresh perspective and new ideas. As you look out the window, the
    sun rises as it pushes the stars away that once guide you. Now it''s up to you
    what to do from here.


    Thanks for playing this short project! This was my
    first game! :)'
